   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNEP Contribution 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Contribution of the Slovak Republic to UNEP in 2023. UNEP is the highest body of the UN for global environmental issues. UNEP is responsible for managing the secretariats of the 7 multilateral environmental conventions.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Pr&#xed;spevok SR do UNEP za rok 2023.&#xa0;UNEP je vrcholn&#xfd;m org&#xe1;nom OSN pre problematiku &#x17e;ivotn&#xe9;ho prostredia v glob&#xe1;lnom meradle. Zodpoved&#xe1; za riadenie sekretari&#xe1;tov 7 multilater&#xe1;lnych environment&#xe1;lnych dohovorov.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Financovanie n&#xe1;kladov sekretari&#xe1;tu a projektov medzin&#xe1;rodnej spolupr&#xe1;ce v oblasti &#x17e;ivotn&#xe9;ho prostredia.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
